<title>USA: Motorola in CDMA trial in Israel.</title>
<headline>Motorola in CDMA trial in Israel.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola's Cellular Infrastructure Group said Monday Pele-Phone Communication Ltd (PCL) of Israel launched a trial of its Code Division Multiple Access (CDMA) wireless phone technology.</p>
<p>The six-month test is being conducted in suburban Tel Aviv. PCL currently operates a nationwide cellular phone system using Motorola equipment.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
